not going to appreciate it.

00:17:29.701 --> 00:17:31.079
They're going to, you know, like,

00:17:31.079 --> 00:17:33.090
but it's, it's all like,

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:35.203
what is where you're at?

00:17:35.203 --> 00:17:36.799
Like, is where you're
at where you want to be?

00:17:36.799 --> 00:17:38.284
Like, are you enjoying it?

00:17:38.284 --> 00:17:41.142
Because I'm, what I'm happy about the most

00:17:41.142 --> 00:17:42.887
is that I enjoy what I do.

00:17:42.887 --> 00:17:43.720
So when I'm doing,

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:45.394
like if I was workin' as a CEO

00:17:45.394 --> 00:17:47.115
of some f--kin' corporation
or somethin' like that

00:17:47.115 --> 00:17:48.565
and I was puttin' all these crazy hours,

00:17:48.565 --> 00:17:50.027
like the same kind of hours I put in now,

00:17:50.027 --> 00:17:51.061
the same kind of effort,

00:17:51.061 --> 00:17:53.064
I'd probably be a miserable, drunk,

00:17:53.064 --> 00:17:55.647
pill-poppin' psychopath who's just lookin'

00:17:55.647 --> 00:17:57.828
to escape and go bang
hookers or somethin'.

00:17:57.828 --> 00:18:00.444
I'd be lookin' for some sort of a release.

